{"tier":"glm-5.2","verse":15,"ref":"2-kings 10:15","book":"2-kings","lang":"de","chapter":10,"translation":"Und er ging von dort weiter und traf ⟨את⟩ Jehonadab, den Sohn Rechabs, der ihm entgegenkam, und er segnete ihn. Und er sagte zu ihm: „Ist ⟨את⟩ dein Herz aufrichtig, wie mein Herz mit deinem Herzen ist?\" Und Jehonadab sagte: „Es ist.\" ⟨„Wenn es ist, gib mir deine Hand.\"⟩ Und er gab ⟨את⟩ seine Hand, und er ließ ihn zu sich auf den Wagen steigen.","tokens":[{"surface":"וילך","gloss":"Und er ging"},{"surface":"משם","gloss":"von dort"},{"surface":"וימצא","gloss":"und traf"},{"surface":"את","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"Jehonadab"},{"surface":"יהונדב","gloss":"Jehonadab"},{"surface":"בן","gloss":"Sohn"},{"surface":"רכב","gloss":"Rechabs"},{"surface":"לקראתו","gloss":"der ihm entgegenkam"},{"surface":"ויברכהו","gloss":"und er segnete ihn"},{"surface":"ויאמר","gloss":"und er sagte"},{"surface":"אליו","gloss":"zu ihm"},{"surface":"היש","gloss":"Ist"},{"surface":"את","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"dein Herz"},{"surface":"לבבך","gloss":"dein Herz"},{"surface":"ישר","gloss":"aufrichtig"},{"surface":"כאשר","gloss":"wie"},{"surface":"לבבי","gloss":"mein Herz"},{"surface":"עם","gloss":"mit"},{"surface":"לבבך","gloss":"deinem Herzen"},{"surface":"ויאמר","gloss":"Und es sagte"},{"surface":"יהונדב","gloss":"Jehonadab"},{"surface":"יש","gloss":"Es ist"},{"surface":"ויש","gloss":" ⟨Es ist⟩"},{"surface":"תנה","gloss":"gib"},{"surface":"את","gloss":"⟨את⟩","marks":"deine Hand"},{"surface":"ידך","gloss":"mir deine Hand"},{"surface":"ויתן","gloss":"Und er gab"},{"surface":"ידו","gloss":"seine Hand"},{"surface":"ויעלהו","gloss":"und er ließ ihn steigen"},{"surface":"אליו","gloss":"zu sich"},{"surface":"אל","gloss":"auf"},{"surface":"המרכבה","gloss":"den Wagen"}],"timestamp":"2026-08-05T21:37:18.642890795Z","model":"glm-5.2"}